    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套色彩鮮豔、花團錦簇的護甲鑄成於 <strong>妖精荒野Feywild</strong> 之中，它充滿着那個奇幻位面的誘人能量。<br />穿着這套護甲期間，你爲防止陷入或結束 <strong>魅惑&amp;Reference[condition=charmed]</strong> 狀態所做的豁免具有優勢。<br />這套護甲具有3發充能。你可以消耗一發充能以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{強迫術 Compulsion}</em>（豁免DC15）。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d3]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>由一件皮外套和護<span class=\"GramE\">脛</span>（可能附有護裙）組合而成，其防護部分由相疊的鐵片覆蓋，結構有如魚的鱗片。<span class=\"GramE\">此護甲同時</span>還附有護手。</p></div></div><p>This colorful, flowery armor was forged in the Feywild and is infused with that plane's captivating magic.</p><p>While wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can use an action to expend a charge to cast the @spell[Compulsion] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from this armor. The armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This armor consists of a coat and leggings (and perhaps a separate skirt) of leather covered with overlapping pieces of metal, much like the scales of a fish. The suit includes gauntlets.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
